                        <span class="topic-card-badge badge-yellow">出題率 25% ★最重要</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="topic-card green" data-goto="page-4-1">
                        <div class="topic-card-icon">⚙️</div>
                        <div class="topic-card-title">4. IPサービス</div>
                        <div class="topic-card-desc">NAT/PAT、DHCP、DNS、NTP、Syslog、SNMP、QoS</div>
